  "scope": "durable Cognitive Silence control plane with deterministic decision taxonomy (ANSWER, WAIT, ASK, DECLINE, SAFE_STOP), strict zero-model-invocation gating, hysteresis against flapping, bounded expiry timeouts, fail-closed service allowlist, and SQLite tamper-evident persistence",
